],\\\"Back to Blog\\\"]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] p-8 md:p-10 shadow-sm prose prose-neutral max-w-none\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"header\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10 not-prose\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Relationships · 6 min read\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Love Score Guide: How It Works \\u0026 What Your Score Means\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You've entered your names, hit calculate, and got a number. But what does your Love Score actually mean? This complete guide walks you through the algorithm, the score ranges, and how to use the result for fun — not fortune-telling.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Is the Love Score Calculator?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The MsgReplier Love Score calculator is a lighthearted compatibility tool that takes two names and produces a percentage score between 0% and 100%. It's designed to be a fun icebreaker, a conversation starter, or a playful way to explore your connection with someone special — not a scientifically validated relationship assessment.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Think of it like a digital version of the FLAMES game you might have played in school. It's not meant to predict your romantic future — it's meant to make you smile, spark a conversation, and add a little playfulness to your relationship.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How the Algorithm Works\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Love Score is calculated using a character-frequency analysis of the two names you enter. Here's the basic process:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ol\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Both names are combined and converted to lowercase.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Each unique letter is counted across both names.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The letter counts are progressively summed and reduced — similar to the classic FLAMES algorithm — until two single digits remain.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Those two digits are combined to form the final percentage score.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This means the result is deterministic: the same two names will always produce the same score. However, the order of the names doesn't matter — \\\\\\\"Alice \\u0026 Bob\\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\"Bob \\u0026 Alice\\\\\\\" will yield the same result.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Each Score Range Means\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Here's a fun breakdown of what different score ranges suggest:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-4 bg-[#eedfc6]/20 rounded-2xl border border-[#d4c3ab] p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🔥 90–100% — Soulmate Level\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-1 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"An incredibly rare score. The stars — and the letters in your names — seem to align perfectly. Whether or not you believe in fate, this is a great excuse to celebrate your connection.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-4 bg-[#eedfc6]/20 rounded-2xl border border-[#d4c3ab] p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"💕 70–89% — Deeply Compatible\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-1 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You two have a strong natural affinity. This range suggests a comfortable, warm compatibility — the kind that makes spending time together feel effortless.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-4 bg-[#eedfc6]/20 rounded-2xl border border-[#d4c3ab] p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"😊 50–69% — Good Match\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-1 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A solid score. You have enough in common to build something meaningful, with enough differences to keep things interesting. Most healthy couples fall somewhere in this range.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-4 bg-[#eedfc6]/20 rounded-2xl border border-[#d4c3ab] p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🌱 30–49% — Room to Grow\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-1 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Don't panic! Some of the most powerful relationships are between people who seem like opposites on the surface. This score just means you'll need to put in the effort to understand each other — and that effort is always worth it.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-4 bg-[#eedfc6]/20 rounded-2xl border border-[#d4c3ab] p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"😅 0–29% — Opposites Attract?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-1 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A low score just means the algorithm wasn't impressed — your real-life chemistry is a completely different story. Use this as a laugh and move on.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Is It Accurate?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Let's be honest: the Love Score is not a scientifically validated compatibility test. Genuine relationship compatibility is shaped by shared values, communication styles, emotional intelligence, life goals, and many other complex factors that no name-based algorithm can capture.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"What the Love Score \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"em\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"is\\\"}],\\\" good for is starting conversations. Try it with a crush, share the result on a first date, or compete with your partner to see who gets the highest score with a fictional character. The point is to have fun and connect — not to make life decisions based on the number.\\\"]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Tips for Getting the Most Out of the Tool\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Try it with nicknames — sometimes a pet name produces a higher score than your real name.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Compare your score with the classic \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/flames\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"FLAMES calculator\\\"}],\\\" for a second opinion.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Screenshot your result and share it with your partner — it's a sweet, low-effort way to show you're thinking of them.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"If you get a low score, try the \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/love-score\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Love Score page\\\"}],\\\" again with a variation of the names — full name versus first name only often produces different results.\\\"]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What to Do After You Get Your Score\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Whether your score is 14% or 99%, the real question is what you do next. Here are a few ideas to keep the romance alive:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Create a Digital Greeting:\\\"}],\\\" Send your partner a personalized surprise using our \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/digital-greeting\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Wishes Website Builder\\\"}],\\\". It's free and takes less than two minutes.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Start a Love-Space Session:\\\"}],\\\" Join a private, real-time chat room with your partner on our \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":